*.kicad_prl
*-bak
*.bak
fp-info-cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
_build/
*.zip

# Fab outputs are build products, not sources: gerbers, PDFs and STEP all embed
# a generation timestamp, so they cannot be byte-reproducible and committing
# them would make the CI drift check permanently red. CI builds and uploads them
# as an artifact instead. The deterministic outputs (bom.csv, netlist.txt) are
# committed.
hardware/outputs/rev-*/
hardware/outputs/schematic/
